  if let Some(p) = prev { ... prev_markdown_source = p.markdown_source; }
  let markdown_source = if markdown { if markdown_unchanged { prev_markdown_source } else { raw_text_borrowed.map(ToOwned::to_owned) } } else { None };
  ```
  Need extract before `let _ = p`.
